('Pioneer 9000 BTU Ductless Heat Pump Mini-Split 23 SEER2','HP-SZ-PIO-9K','HP-SZ-PIO-9K','Pioneer','air_conditioner','heat-pump-single-zone','Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split',9000,471.15,349.00,44,88,12,35,25,15,'Up to 400 sq ft','23 SEER2','R-410A','115V','NEMA 5-15','1-Phase','60Hz','A 9,000 BTU inverter-driven ductless heat pump that both cools in summer and heats down to roughly 5 F ambient, making it a year-round replacement for a window air conditioner plus a space heater. The variable-speed inverter compressor modulates instead of cycling on and off, which holds room temperature within about one degree and cuts running cost against fixed-speed equipment. At 23 SEER2 it qualifies for most utility efficiency programs. The system ships as a matched pair: a wall-mounted indoor head with washable filter and a compact outdoor condenser, connected by a 16 ft flare-fitted line set. It runs on a standard 115V circuit, so no service upgrade is needed for light residential retrofits, garages, sunrooms, offices and small server closets. Sold to HVAC contractors and distributors; installation requires vacuum evacuation and torque-set flare joints by a qualified technician.','{"Unit Type":"Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split","Cooling Capacity":"9,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"9,600 BTU/h","Coverage Area":"Up to 400 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"23 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to 5 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"115V","Plug Type":"NEMA 5-15","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Line Set":"16 ft included","Sound Level":"32 dB indoor"}','["Indoor wall-mounted head","Outdoor condenser","16 ft line set","Wall bracket and drain hose","Wireless remote","Installation manual"]','["Residential retrofit","Garage and workshop","Home office","Sunroom","Small server room"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',60,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-PIO-9K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-PIO-9K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-PIO-9K-2.jpg"}'),
('Pioneer 12000 BTU Ductless Heat Pump Mini-Split 21.5 SEER2','HP-SZ-PIO-12K','HP-SZ-PIO-12K','Pioneer','air_conditioner','heat-pump-single-zone','Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split',12000,538.65,399.00,40,80,12,35,25,15,'Up to 550 sq ft','21.5 SEER2','R-410A','115V','NEMA 5-15','1-Phase','60Hz','The 12,000 BTU (one ton) inverter heat pump is the volume seller of the ductless category because it covers the typical 450 to 550 sq ft living room, master bedroom or open-plan office on a single 115V circuit. Heating output holds usable capacity to roughly 5 F outdoor ambient, so in most of the southern and central United States it carries the shoulder seasons without auxiliary heat. The inverter compressor ramps between about 30 and 110 percent of rated capacity, trimming electrical demand and keeping indoor humidity in check during long part-load runs. Included with the matched pair is a 16 ft insulated line set with pre-flared ends, wall sleeve, condensate hose and wireless remote with weekly timer. Distributors and contractors buying by the pallet or container receive tiered unit pricing; single units are available at the listed price.','{"Unit Type":"Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split","Cooling Capacity":"12,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"12,700 BTU/h","Coverage Area":"Up to 550 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"21.5 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to 5 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"115V","Plug Type":"NEMA 5-15","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Line Set":"16 ft included","Sound Level":"34 dB indoor"}','["Indoor wall-mounted head","Outdoor condenser","16 ft line set","Wall bracket and drain hose","Wireless remote","Installation manual"]','["Residential retrofit","Open-plan office","Master bedroom","Rental apartment","Light commercial"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',60,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-PIO-12K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-PIO-12K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-PIO-12K-2.jpg"}'),
('MRCOOL DIY 12000 BTU Heat Pump Mini-Split 22 SEER2','HP-SZ-MRC-12K','HP-SZ-MRC-12K','MRCOOL','air_conditioner','heat-pump-single-zone','Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split',12000,660.15,489.00,36,72,12,35,25,15,'Up to 550 sq ft','22 SEER2','R-410A','115V','NEMA 5-15','1-Phase','60Hz','A 12,000 BTU heat pump built around a pre-charged quick-connect line set, which removes the vacuum-and-charge step from the installation and makes it the fastest unit in this range to commission. That matters for property managers and volume installers: a two-person crew can typically set the indoor head, hang the condenser and energise in a single visit. Cooling and heating are both inverter-driven at 22 SEER2, with heating capacity maintained to roughly 5 F ambient and a self-diagnostic board that reports fault codes at the indoor display. Wi-Fi control is built in, so tenants and facility staff can schedule setpoints from a phone without a wall thermostat. Ships as a matched pair with a 16 ft pre-charged line set, mounting hardware, drain hose and remote. Sold wholesale to contractors, distributors and property portfolios.','{"Unit Type":"Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split","Cooling Capacity":"12,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"12,500 BTU/h","Coverage Area":"Up to 550 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"22 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to 5 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A (pre-charged line set)","Voltage":"115V","Plug Type":"NEMA 5-15","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Connectivity":"Wi-Fi app control","Line Set":"16 ft pre-charged quick-connect"}','["Indoor wall-mounted head","Outdoor condenser","16 ft pre-charged quick-connect line set","Wall bracket and drain hose","Wireless remote","Installation manual"]','["Property management","Fast retrofit","Accessory dwelling unit","Home addition","Short-term rental"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',48,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-MRC-12K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-MRC-12K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-MRC-12K-2.jpg"}'),
('Senville AURA 18000 BTU Heat Pump Mini-Split 20 SEER2','HP-SZ-SEN-18K','HP-SZ-SEN-18K','Senville','air_conditioner','heat-pump-single-zone','Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split',18000,781.65,579.00,30,60,12,35,25,15,'Up to 900 sq ft','20 SEER2','R-410A','230V','Hardwired','1-Phase','60Hz','An 18,000 BTU (1.5 ton) inverter heat pump for larger open areas: great rooms, retail floors, restaurant dining rooms and finished basements between roughly 700 and 900 sq ft. Rated heating operation extends to about -22 F ambient with a base pan heater and low-ambient control board, which puts it in genuine cold-climate service rather than shoulder-season only. The unit runs on a dedicated 230V circuit and is hardwired through a disconnect at the condenser. Cooling efficiency is 20 SEER2 and the compressor is inverter-modulated, so long low-speed runs dehumidify better than a single-stage system of the same nominal size. Supplied as a matched pair with a 16 ft line set, wall bracket, drain assembly and backlit remote. Contractor and distributor volume pricing applies from five units; container quantities receive the lowest unit cost.','{"Unit Type":"Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split","Cooling Capacity":"18,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"19,000 BTU/h","Coverage Area":"Up to 900 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"20 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to -22 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"Hardwired","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Line Set":"16 ft included","Sound Level":"38 dB indoor"}','["Indoor wall-mounted head","Outdoor condenser","16 ft line set","Wall bracket and drain hose","Wireless remote","Installation manual"]','["Great room","Retail floor","Restaurant dining room","Finished basement","Cold-climate retrofit"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',40,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-SEN-18K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-SEN-18K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-SEN-18K-2.jpg"}'),
('Cooper & Hunter Sophia 24000 BTU Heat Pump Mini-Split 19 SEER2','HP-SZ-CH-24K','HP-SZ-CH-24K','Cooper & Hunter','air_conditioner','heat-pump-single-zone','Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split',24000,943.65,699.00,26,52,12,35,25,15,'Up to 1,200 sq ft','19 SEER2','R-410A','230V','Hardwired','1-Phase','60Hz','A 24,000 BTU (two ton) inverter heat pump sized for whole-floor apartments, open offices and light commercial spaces of roughly 1,000 to 1,200 sq ft where a single indoor head can serve the load. Heating is rated to about -13 F ambient, and the low-ambient board with crankcase and pan heaters allows continuous winter operation. The 230V hardwired condenser uses a rotary inverter compressor with electronic expansion valve control, holding superheat steady across a wide capacity band. Cooling rates at 19 SEER2. Because a single 24,000 BTU head throws air a long distance, it suits rectangular rooms better than partitioned layouts; partitioned floors are better served by the multi-zone systems in this section. Includes matched indoor head, condenser, 16 ft line set, drain assembly and remote with weekly scheduling. Wholesale tiers begin at five units.','{"Unit Type":"Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split","Cooling Capacity":"24,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"25,000 BTU/h","Coverage Area":"Up to 1,200 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"19 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to -13 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"Hardwired","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Line Set":"16 ft included","Sound Level":"42 dB indoor"}','["Indoor wall-mounted head","Outdoor condenser","16 ft line set","Wall bracket and drain hose","Wireless remote","Installation manual"]','["Whole-floor apartment","Open office","Light commercial","Warehouse office","Church hall"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',36,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-CH-24K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-CH-24K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-CH-24K-2.jpg"}'),
('Della 36000 BTU Heat Pump Mini-Split 17.5 SEER2','HP-SZ-DEL-36K','HP-SZ-DEL-36K','Della','air_conditioner','heat-pump-single-zone','Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split',36000,1281.15,949.00,18,36,12,35,25,15,'Up to 1,600 sq ft','17.5 SEER2','R-410A','230V','Hardwired','1-Phase','60Hz','A 36,000 BTU (three ton) inverter heat pump for large single-volume spaces: workshops, gyms, showrooms, prefabricated commercial units and warehouse mezzanines up to roughly 1,600 sq ft. At this capacity the indoor head is a wide-body wall cassette with a high-static blower, so it can push conditioned air across an open bay without ductwork. Heating operates to about -13 F ambient and cooling rates at 17.5 SEER2. The condenser is 230V single-phase and hardwired through a fused disconnect; a 25 ft line set is recommended for typical mechanical-yard placement and is available separately. Because of unit weight and refrigerant charge, commissioning must be performed by a licensed technician with recovery and evacuation equipment. Sold to trade buyers; five-unit and container pricing shown at checkout.','{"Unit Type":"Single-Zone Heat Pump Mini-Split","Cooling Capacity":"36,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"38,000 BTU/h","Coverage Area":"Up to 1,600 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"17.5 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to -13 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"Hardwired","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Line Set":"16 ft included","Sound Level":"46 dB indoor"}','["Indoor wide-body head","Outdoor condenser","16 ft line set","Wall bracket and drain hose","Wireless remote","Installation manual"]','["Workshop","Gym","Showroom","Warehouse mezzanine","Prefabricated commercial unit"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',24,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-DEL-36K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-DEL-36K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-DEL-36K-2.jpg"}'),
('Pioneer 12000 BTU Ceiling Cassette Heat Pump 19 SEER2','HP-SZ-PIO-CAS-12K','HP-SZ-PIO-CAS-12K','Pioneer','air_conditioner','heat-pump-single-zone','Ceiling Cassette Heat Pump',12000,1213.65,899.00,20,40,12,35,25,15,'Up to 550 sq ft','19 SEER2','R-410A','230V','Hardwired','1-Phase','60Hz','A four-way ceiling cassette heat pump that recesses into a suspended grid and distributes air through 360 degrees, which is the standard solution for offices, clinics, salons and hotel suites where a wall head would look out of place or blow directly at occupants. The 12,000 BTU inverter system heats to about 5 F ambient and cools at 19 SEER2. A built-in condensate lift pump raises drainage roughly 750 mm, so the cassette can be placed away from a gravity drain line. The decorative panel is included and the chassis fits a standard 600 mm ceiling module opening. Installation requires ceiling void depth of at least 260 mm, a 230V hardwired supply and licensed refrigerant handling. Supplied with cassette, decorative panel, condenser, line set, wired controller and remote. Trade pricing from five units.','{"Unit Type":"Ceiling Cassette Heat Pump","Cooling Capacity":"12,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"12,700 BTU/h","Coverage Area":"Up to 550 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"19 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to 5 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"Hardwired","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Ceiling Void Required":"260 mm minimum","Condensate Lift":"750 mm built-in pump"}','["Ceiling cassette chassis","Decorative panel","Outdoor condenser","16 ft line set","Wired controller and remote","Installation manual"]','["Office","Medical clinic","Salon","Hotel suite","Conference room"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',24,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-PIO-CAS-12K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-PIO-CAS-12K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-SZ-PIO-CAS-12K-2.jpg"}'),
('Pioneer 18000 BTU Dual-Zone Heat Pump Multi-Split','HP-MZ-PIO-18K','HP-MZ-PIO-18K','Pioneer','air_conditioner','heat-pump-multi-zone','Dual-Zone Heat Pump Multi-Split',18000,1078.65,799.00,20,40,12,35,25,15,'2 rooms up to 800 sq ft','20 SEER2','R-410A','230V','Hardwired','1-Phase','60Hz','One outdoor condenser feeding two independently controlled indoor heads, each with its own thermostat and schedule. This is the right configuration for a two-bedroom apartment, a duplex, or an office plus adjoining conference room, where separate setpoints matter and roof or wall space allows only one condenser. Total rated capacity is 18,000 BTU, typically split as two 9,000 BTU heads; other head combinations can be quoted. Heating runs to about -13 F ambient and cooling rates at 20 SEER2. Each zone modulates independently, so an unoccupied room can idle while the other runs at full output. The 230V condenser is hardwired and requires two separate line sets, sized per head and ordered to the measured run. Installation is trade only: nitrogen pressure test, evacuation to 500 microns and weighed-in charge adjustment are required.','{"Unit Type":"Dual-Zone Heat Pump Multi-Split","Cooling Capacity":"18,000 BTU/h total","Heating Capacity":"19,000 BTU/h total","Zones":"2 independently controlled heads","Coverage Area":"2 rooms up to 800 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"20 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to -13 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"Hardwired","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz"}','["2 indoor wall-mounted heads","Outdoor condenser","Wall brackets and drain hoses","2 wireless remotes","Installation manual"]','["Two-bedroom apartment","Duplex","Office and conference room","Upstairs and downstairs zoning","Guest suite"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',28,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-MZ-PIO-18K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-MZ-PIO-18K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-MZ-PIO-18K-2.jpg"}'),
('MRCOOL 27000 BTU Tri-Zone Heat Pump Multi-Split','HP-MZ-MRC-27K','HP-MZ-MRC-27K','MRCOOL','air_conditioner','heat-pump-multi-zone','Tri-Zone Heat Pump Multi-Split',27000,1416.15,1049.00,14,28,12,35,25,15,'3 rooms up to 1,200 sq ft','19 SEER2','R-410A','230V','Hardwired','1-Phase','60Hz','A three-zone inverter heat pump system: one 27,000 BTU condenser driving three indoor heads that each heat and cool on their own schedule. It is the workhorse configuration for three-bedroom homes, small clinics with separate treatment rooms, and offices split into partitioned areas, because it avoids three separate condensers and three sets of wall penetrations. Heating capacity holds to about -13 F ambient and cooling rates at 19 SEER2. Head combinations are flexible within the total connected capacity, commonly 9K/9K/9K or 12K/9K/6K; specify the mix when ordering and we will supply matched heads. The condenser needs a dedicated 230V circuit and a fused disconnect. Line sets are per zone and cut to the measured run. Commissioning requires nitrogen pressure test, deep evacuation and charge trim by refrigerant weight, so installation is licensed trade only.','{"Unit Type":"Tri-Zone Heat Pump Multi-Split","Cooling Capacity":"27,000 BTU/h total","Heating Capacity":"28,000 BTU/h total","Zones":"3 independently controlled heads","Coverage Area":"3 rooms up to 1,200 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"19 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to -13 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"Hardwired","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz"}','["3 indoor wall-mounted heads","Outdoor condenser","Wall brackets and drain hoses","3 wireless remotes","Installation manual"]','["Three-bedroom home","Clinic with treatment rooms","Partitioned office","Multi-room retail","Rental conversion"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',20,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-MZ-MRC-27K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-MZ-MRC-27K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-MZ-MRC-27K-2.jpg"}'),
('Senville 36000 BTU Quad-Zone Heat Pump Multi-Split','HP-MZ-SEN-36K','HP-MZ-SEN-36K','Senville','air_conditioner','heat-pump-multi-zone','Quad-Zone Heat Pump Multi-Split',36000,1726.65,1279.00,10,20,12,35,25,15,'4 rooms up to 1,600 sq ft','18 SEER2','R-410A','230V','Hardwired','1-Phase','60Hz','A four-zone inverter heat pump built for whole-house or whole-floor projects where every room needs its own setpoint from a single outdoor unit. Total connected capacity is 36,000 BTU across four indoor heads, typically 9K/9K/9K/9K or 12K/12K/6K/6K depending on room loads. Heating is rated to about -22 F ambient with base pan heater and low-ambient control, so it can serve as the primary heating system in cold-climate retrofits where ductwork is impractical. Cooling rates at 18 SEER2. Each head has an independent electronic expansion valve, so zones can run at very different loads without starving one another. The condenser requires a dedicated 230V circuit sized to nameplate MCA, and each zone needs its own line set cut to the measured run. Licensed installation with evacuation and weighed charge trim is mandatory.','{"Unit Type":"Quad-Zone Heat Pump Multi-Split","Cooling Capacity":"36,000 BTU/h total","Heating Capacity":"38,000 BTU/h total","Zones":"4 independently controlled heads","Coverage Area":"4 rooms up to 1,600 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"18 SEER2","Heating Range":"Down to -22 F ambient","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"Hardwired","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz"}','["4 indoor wall-mounted heads","Outdoor condenser","Wall brackets and drain hoses","4 wireless remotes","Installation manual"]','["Whole-house zoning","Cold-climate retrofit","Multi-office suite","Boutique hotel floor","Ductless new build"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',16,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-MZ-SEN-36K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-MZ-SEN-36K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-MZ-SEN-36K-2.jpg"}'),
('Amana 9000 BTU PTAC Heat Pump 230V with Electric Backup','HP-PT-AMA-9K','HP-PT-AMA-9K','Amana','air_conditioner','heat-pump-ptac','PTAC Heat Pump',9000,741.15,549.00,32,64,12,35,25,15,'Up to 400 sq ft','11.0 EER','R-410A','230V','NEMA 6-20','1-Phase','60Hz','A packaged terminal heat pump that slides into the industry-standard 42 x 16 inch wall sleeve used across hotels, motels, assisted-living rooms and student housing. Everything is in one chassis, so replacement is a swap rather than a refrigeration job: pull the old unit, slide the new one into the existing sleeve, connect the cord and set the front controls. The heat pump reverses for heating and hands off to 3.5 kW electric resistance backup when outdoor temperature drops below the balance point, so the room stays warm in any climate. Cooling rates at 11.0 EER with a washable filter and front-panel or wired-thermostat control. Sold in case and pallet quantities to hospitality buyers, property managers and contractors; a new sleeve and exterior grille can be quoted with the order if the existing opening is being rebuilt.','{"Unit Type":"PTAC Heat Pump","Cooling Capacity":"9,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"8,500 BTU/h heat pump plus 3.5 kW electric backup","Coverage Area":"Up to 400 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"11.0 EER","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"NEMA 6-20","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Sleeve Size":"42 x 16 in standard","Control":"Front panel or wired thermostat"}','["PTAC chassis","Front panel and filter","Power cord","Installation manual"]','["Hotel and motel room","Assisted living","Student housing","Apartment retrofit","Dormitory"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',48,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-PT-AMA-9K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-PT-AMA-9K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-PT-AMA-9K-2.jpg"}'),
('Amana 12000 BTU PTAC Heat Pump 230V with Electric Backup','HP-PT-AMA-12K','HP-PT-AMA-12K','Amana','air_conditioner','heat-pump-ptac','PTAC Heat Pump',12000,849.15,629.00,28,56,12,35,25,15,'Up to 550 sq ft','10.7 EER','R-410A','230V','NEMA 6-20','1-Phase','60Hz','The 12,000 BTU packaged terminal heat pump is the standard specification for larger hotel rooms, suites and one-bedroom apartments that exceed the capacity of a 9,000 BTU chassis. It fits the same 42 x 16 inch wall sleeve, so a property can mix capacities across a floor without changing openings. Reversing-valve heating is supplemented by 5 kW electric resistance backup for design-day conditions and defrost cycles. Cooling rates at 10.7 EER, and the chassis includes a washable filter, corrosion-treated coils suited to coastal properties and front-panel or remote wall thermostat control. Buyers usually order by pallet for renovation projects; unit pricing improves at five, twenty and full-container quantities. Delivery is by freight to a dock or lift-gate address, and we can stage shipments floor by floor on request.','{"Unit Type":"PTAC Heat Pump","Cooling Capacity":"12,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"11,500 BTU/h heat pump plus 5 kW electric backup","Coverage Area":"Up to 550 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"10.7 EER","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"NEMA 6-20","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Sleeve Size":"42 x 16 in standard","Coil Treatment":"Corrosion-resistant"}','["PTAC chassis","Front panel and filter","Power cord","Installation manual"]','["Hotel suite","One-bedroom apartment","Assisted living","Extended-stay property","Office retrofit"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',40,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-PT-AMA-12K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-PT-AMA-12K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-PT-AMA-12K-2.jpg"}'),
('GE Zoneline 15000 BTU PTAC Heat Pump 230V','HP-PT-GE-15K','HP-PT-GE-15K','GE','air_conditioner','heat-pump-ptac','PTAC Heat Pump',15000,997.65,739.00,24,48,12,35,25,15,'Up to 700 sq ft','10.2 EER','R-410A','230V','NEMA 6-30','1-Phase','60Hz','A 15,000 BTU packaged terminal heat pump for the largest rooms on a hospitality or multifamily floor plate: corner suites, lobbies, meeting rooms and two-room units up to roughly 700 sq ft. It uses the same 42 x 16 inch sleeve as smaller chassis but draws more current, so verify the branch circuit and receptacle before specifying. Heating is heat-pump-first with 5 kW electric resistance backup, and the control board includes freeze protection plus optional energy-management occupancy input, which properties use to set back unoccupied rooms automatically. Cooling rates at 10.2 EER. The chassis is serviceable from the front with a slide-out refrigeration assembly, keeping downtime short during a room turn. Sold wholesale by pallet and container to property groups, general contractors and mechanical distributors.','{"Unit Type":"PTAC Heat Pump","Cooling Capacity":"15,000 BTU/h","Heating Capacity":"14,000 BTU/h heat pump plus 5 kW electric backup","Coverage Area":"Up to 700 sq ft","Efficiency Rating":"10.2 EER","Refrigerant":"R-410A","Voltage":"230V","Plug Type":"NEMA 6-30","Phase":"1-Phase","Frequency":"60Hz","Sleeve Size":"42 x 16 in standard","Control":"Front panel, wired thermostat or energy management input"}','["PTAC chassis","Front panel and filter","Power cord","Installation manual"]','["Corner hotel suite","Lobby","Meeting room","Two-room apartment","Care facility"]','Home & Garden > Household Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Conditioners','new','in_stock',32,false,false,'https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-PT-GE-15K.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-PT-GE-15K.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/HP-PT-GE-15K-2.jpg"}');